@startuml
title TheDarkOfDarkness - First Floor (Planned)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
left to right direction

rectangle "First Floor Landing\nitems: mirror shard #2 placement zone\npurpose: reflected light step" as landing
rectangle "Library\ncontains: Bookshelf location" as library
rectangle "Bookshelf\nbooks include:\n- Bullet Making for Dummies\n- Fifty Shades of Prey\n- How to Win Fights with Interpretive Dance\n- Necromancy for People Who Hate Mornings\n- 101 Uses for Haunted Cutlery\n- The Complete Guide to Overthinking Traps" as bookshelf
rectangle "Study\ncontains: Sunlight Stream, Small Forge, Bullet Mold" as study
rectangle "Sunlight Stream\nuse: place mirror shard #1" as sunlight
rectangle "Small Forge\ninput: silver cutlery\noutput: melted silver" as forge
rectangle "Bullet Mold\noutput: silver bullets\nrequirements: melted silver + 'Bullet Making for Dummies'" as mold
rectangle "Bathroom\nNPC: Vampire\nitems: mirror shards\ndefeat: stake with Wooden sword\ndrop: Wand handle (wand half #1)" as bathroom
rectangle "Ballroom\nNPC: Troll\ndefeat: sunlight via final mirror shard\nitems: display gun, silver cutlery\ndrop: Wand tip (wand half #2)" as ballroom
rectangle "Stair to Tower\nitems: TBD" as towerStairs
rectangle "Death: Vampire\nThe vampire drains you dry in seconds.\nWith your last thought: 'If only I had something made of wood...'\nThe End.\nRestart available." as vampireDeath
rectangle "Death: Troll\nThe troll tears you apart before the sunlight trap is set.\nAs the world goes black: 'If only it were not so dark in here...'\nThe End.\nRestart available." as trollDeath

landing --> library : west
landing --> study : north
landing --> bathroom : bathroom (bring Wooden sword)
landing --> ballroom : ballroom (requires final shard + shard #1 and #2 placements)
landing --> towerStairs : up
library --> bookshelf : inspect shelf
bookshelf --> library : back
library --> landing : exit / leave
study --> sunlight : use sunlight stream
sunlight --> study : back
study --> forge : use forge
forge --> study : back
study --> mold : use bullet mold
mold --> study : back
ballroom --> forge : carry silver cutlery
forge --> mold : provide melted silver
bookshelf --> mold : provide bullet-making guide
study --> landing : reflected light path
bathroom --> landing : exit
ballroom --> landing : exit
mold --> ballroom : craft silver bullets for gun
landing --> trollDeath : ballroom without shard setup
bathroom --> vampireDeath : face vampire without Wooden sword

note bottom of landing
This level is requested for mapping but is not
implemented in TheDarkOfDarkness code yet.
end note

@enduml
